From 70e56296140fb7a2b3748d6b4bf6aaa5cce70d4c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: starbite <starbite@local>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:44:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] patch: 0345-starlte-microsd-driver.patch - STARLTE microSD
 (dwmmc2 0x11500000): polling read-only block device after shim/starlte/sd.c,
 CMD9 card size, MBR/EBR + sdroot= range (pN | lba:START,COUNT, no default,
 FAT/exFAT/NTFS/store refused), devfs sdroot0/rsdroot0, sdprobe=1/2 (MBR, p1
 boot sector, p2 SBSTORE2 header/directory CRCs, throughput; 2 = sdhold then a
 deliberate panic); no write path - review: sd_recover after every failed read
 (controller+FIFO reset, UPD_CLK, CMD12 stop_abort, CMD13 tran), second
 rootdev call panics (failed mount), gates/rails/GPA1 printed and checked
 before the controller, CLKSEL timing-field RMW, lba: refuses logical data
 partitions and the store below its used end, reread err vs DIFF

---
 bsd/conf/files       |    1 +
 bsd/dev/starlte_sd.c | 1370 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 1371 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 bsd/dev/starlte_sd.c

diff --git a/bsd/conf/files b/bsd/conf/files
index ad533bbe..ba9d06c6 100644
--- a/bsd/conf/files
+++ b/bsd/conf/files
@@ -111,6 +111,7 @@ bsd/dev/starlte_touch.c			standard
 bsd/dev/starlte_smp.c			standard
 bsd/dev/starlte_gpu.c			standard
 bsd/dev/starlte_overlay.c		standard
+bsd/dev/starlte_sd.c			standard
 bsd/dev/herolte_battery.c		standard
 bsd/dev/herolte_gpu.c			standard
 bsd/dev/a5xelte_keys.c			standard
